  "body": "To download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/211A\r\n\r\nPositioned in an elevated setting with sweeping coastal views, 20 Durness Road presents a standout opportunity to secure a substantial blank canvas at one of the most desirable addresses Red Beach has to offer.\r\n\r\nThe outlook is expansive and simply breathtaking, offering the perfect backdrop for a future build designed to maximise the coastal setting.\r\nComprising approximately 2,039m² of cleared land, the site is ready for development with resource consent already in place for two architecturally designed dwellings or to build one impressive dream home.  The groundwork has been done, allowing you to move forward with confidence and bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to create a striking coastal residence, develop and add value, or landbank for the future, the flexibility here is a real advantage.\r\n\r\nLocated in sought-after Red Beach, just moments from pristine beaches, with access from the property to the clifftop reserve.  Motorway access is a short drive away and easy reach to Orewa, Silverdale and local village amenities, this address delivers both lifestyle and convenience.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure land of this scale, with consent already in place and views of this calibre, are increasingly rare.\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to contact us for information regarding what completed high-end homes are selling for in the area.",
